	(text "NOTES\nF401 within 7 in of battery +. Charge with SW401 OFF.\nNever switch PPBA hub port 1 off in software: it powers the Pi.\n24V_RTN is not GND (PS401 is isolated). Each driver gets its own wires from PS401.\nENA- low = driver OFF.\n\nOPEN: motor models (they set SW1-3 and PS401's size), dew heater model, mirror fan power, surge protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
